# Telemetry provider config — NEVER commit.
#
# Catalyst links no analytics SDK today (Telemetry/Telemetry.swift is a no-op facade). This is
# a standing guard: it's the filename Firebase tooling emits by convention, and on a PUBLIC repo
# a single `git add -A` would publish it permanently. The real file is CODEOWNERS-held and
# distributed out of band. See Telemetry/README.md.
Telemetry/GoogleService-Info.plist